    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "body": "Migrate to (and, initially, add) providing sub-commands for the different features of the `cython` command:\r\n\r\n  - `cython MODULE.pyx` -> `cython compile MODULE.pyx`\r\n  - `cython --shared cyshared MODULE.pyx` -> `cython compile --shared MODULE.pyx`\r\n  - `cython --generate-shared cyshared.c` -> `cython generate-shared cyshared.c`\r\n  - `cython --generage-shared cyshared.c --shared-exclude MemoryView` -> `cython generate-shared --shared-exclude MemoryView cyshared.c`\r\n  - `cythonize -fib MODULE.pyx` -> `cython build -fi MODULE.PYX`\r\n\r\n_Originally posted by @matusvalo in https://github.com/cython/cython/issues/7800#issuecomment-4896378636_",
